## MTECH OS — variant ya Kali Linux (OS HALISI kama Kali)
##   Jenga:  ./mtech-os/kali/build-iso.sh            # Kali kamili (≈ kali-linux-large)
##           ./mtech-os/kali/build-iso.sh --everything  # zana ZOTE za Kali (kali-linux-everything)

## Live images always want these
kali-linux-core
kali-desktop-live

## Desktop halisi ya Kali (kama picha: XFCE + dragon wallpaper + panel + menyu za zana)
kali-desktop-xfce
kali-themes
kali-wallpapers-2022
kali-menu
kali-tweaks
xdg-user-dirs
gvfs-backends
firefox-esr
conky-all

## Zana za Kali halisi
##   kali-linux-large  = seti kamili ya Kali rasmi (kali-linux-default + extra, ≈ tools 400+)
##   kali-linux-everything = ZOTE (~1800) — badalishwa na build-iso.sh --everything
kali-linux-large
## (metasploit-framework, wireshark, burpsuite, hashcat, nmap… zote zimo NDANI ya
##  kali-linux-large — hatutaziandika tena kwa jina ili kuepuka makosa ya majina)

## Dock/desktop za Kali (zinazotajwa na xfce4-panel.xml na hook ya icons)
kali-undercover
network-manager-applet
mousepad
xfce4-appfinder

## Kernel na DRIVERS halisi za Kali (WiFi, GPU, USB, sound…)
linux-image-amd64
linux-headers-amd64
firmware-linux
