wmctrl
scrot
xclip
imagemagick
pulseaudio-utils

## RUST — kasi na usalama wa OS (compiler + toolchain halisi za Debian/Kali)
rustc
cargo

## R — charti/picha/visualizations za OS yenye mvuto wa kipekee
r-base
r-base-dev
r-recommended
libcurl4-openssl-dev
libssl-dev
libxml2-dev

## LIBREOFFICE ILIYOBORESHWA — kazi zote za ofisi (Word/Excel/PowerPoint/PDF)
libreoffice
libreoffice-gtk3
libreoffice-l10n-sw
libreoffice-style-breeze

